# pizero-platform

The Waveshare PiZero family: an RP2 chip on a board in the Raspberry Pi Zero's
outline, with its 40-pin header, a DVI connector, a TF card socket, and two
USB-C sockets, the native port and a PIO-USB port. rp2350_pizero is the
RP2350-PiZero.

The board binds no provider yet: modules/mm has no DVI output, and the TF
card and PIO-USB port are described here and in its manifest for the
providers that will use them.
